WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.070
- You tweeted this a
bit ago and I love this

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:04.540
'cause it shows so much
of your sense of humor.

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:05.960
But, "I know. I'll run for president.

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.490
I'll make some romantic music.

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:10.692
Everybody will get laid. And
everybody will be happy again."

00:00:10.692 --> 00:00:13.525
(audience laughs)

00:00:15.012 --> 00:00:17.840
I'll make some romantic
music. Everyone will get laid.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:20.870
And will be happy again. There
is some truth to that, Barry.

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:21.910
Some real truth.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:23.520
- I'm your guy.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.980
- I would vote for you.
I think it's a good plan.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.170
Would you ever run for--

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:29.850
Would you ever do anything
in political field?

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:30.683
- Never, never, never.

00:00:30.683 --> 00:00:32.580
- I always think, "why do you do that?"

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.360
It's like coaching a Texas football team.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:37.720
It's like all the coaches, it's
like, when they're winning,

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:39.570
they're like, "Oh, it's the
team. You just lucked out."

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:41.499
And then when you're losing,
then the coach sucks.

00:00:41.499 --> 00:00:43.650
It's like, you can't win.

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:47.028
- Listen, it's a very, very
complicated thing to do.

00:00:47.028 --> 00:00:50.400
I, you know, I got my
own opinions, but no,

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.250
I never, never get even near that.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:56.050
- I think most artists
are too unfiltered, too.

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:58.350
I think that you have to have
like this polish about you

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.950
and artists are generally
like, "No, this is how I feel."

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:01.783
- Right.

00:01:01.783 --> 00:01:03.346
- Yeah, this is what I really
wanted to say, so I said it.

00:01:03.346 --> 00:01:04.640
- No. I just want to
make people feel good.

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:06.438
And that's where I stopped.

00:01:06.438 --> 00:01:07.410
(audience applauds)

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:08.950
- I think that making music

00:01:08.950 --> 00:01:11.940
that people get laid to is
amazing. I think job well done.

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:13.600
Those are some positive
footprints you're leaving

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:14.480
in this world.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:15.887
All right, I'm with you.

